WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.380
I'm Rerun.

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.955
My shell is glass,
and the receipts are inside it.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:06.890
That is the point.

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:11.130
A claim should carry its own evidence,
so anyone can run the check again.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:14.520
I knock on a claim to hear
whether anything is in there.

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:17.200
Sometimes my guess is wrong.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.990
I keep count of those,
right here on my claw.
